&"SAVED / RESTART NOT REQUIRED": &"已保存 / 无需重新启动",
&"Fullscreen uses your desktop resolution. Window resolution applies in windowed mode. F11 toggles fullscreen.": &"全屏使用桌面分辨率；窗口分辨率仅在窗口模式生效。按 F11 切换全屏。",
&"Could not save: ": &"无法保存：",
&"PAUSED": &"已暂停",
&"RESUME": &"继续游戏",
&"Simulation stopped. Esc resumes. Saves resume at base; mid-mission progress is not saved.": &"游戏已暂停。按 Esc 继续。存档从基地恢复，不保存任务中的即时进度。",
&"ABANDON MISSION / RETURN TO BASE": &"放弃任务 / 返回基地",
&"RETURN TO BASE": &"返回基地",
&"MAIN MENU": &"主菜单",
&"SAVE & QUIT": &"保存并退出",
&"ABANDON & QUIT": &"放弃任务并退出",
&"ACTION UNAVAILABLE": &"当前无法操作",
&"BACK / RETRY": &"返回 / 重试",
&"DISCARD UNAVAILABLE SORTIE / RETURN TO BASE": &"放弃异常出击 / 返回基地",
&"PAUSE / EXIT OPTIONS": &"暂停 / 退出选项",
&"RETURN TO BASE?": &"返回基地？",
&"This discards the unavailable sortie. Your last warehouse state remains intact.": &"将放弃此次异常出击，保留上次仓库状态。",
&"CANCEL": &"取消",
&"DISCARD SORTIE / RETURN TO BASE": &"放弃此次出击 / 返回基地",
&"ABANDON THIS MISSION?": &"放弃当前任务？",
&"Mission progress and loot collected on this sortie will be lost. Your pre-deployment warehouse and equipment remain available.": &"本次任务进度和搜刮物品将丢失；出击前的仓库与装备将保留。",
&"CANCEL / KEEP PLAYING": &"取消 / 继续游戏",
&"ABANDON & ": &"放弃任务并返回：",
&"SORTIE RECOVERY": &"出击状态恢复",
&"The sortie cannot be committed. The warehouse is intact. Discard this unavailable sortie to continue.": &"无法结算此次出击，仓库未受影响。放弃异常出击后继续。",
&"BACK TO EXIT OPTIONS": &"返回退出选项",
&"DISCARD SORTIE / ": &"放弃出击 / ",
&"COULD NOT SAVE": &"无法保存",
&"RETRY SAVE": &"重试保存",
&"QUIT WITHOUT SAVING": &"不保存并退出",
&"CONTINUE WITHOUT SAVING": &"不保存并继续",
&"SAVE RECOVERY": &"存档恢复",
&"The saved profile is unreadable or unsupported. The original file will be archived before recovery. Choose a valid backup or start fresh; no automatic overwrite occurs.": &"存档损坏或版本不受支持。恢复前会归档原文件。请选择有效备份，或开始新游戏；不会自动覆盖原存档。",
&"RETRY ORIGINAL SAVE": &"重试读取原存档",
&"RESTORE LAST VALID BACKUP": &"恢复最近的有效备份",
&"ARCHIVE BROKEN SAVE / START FRESH": &"归档损坏存档 / 开始新游戏",
&"QUIT / KEEP FILES": &"退出 / 保留文件",
&"Error: %s. Progress is still in memory. Check disk space and permissions, then retry. Continuing without saving retains progress only until the app closes.": &"错误：%s。进度仍保留在内存中。请检查磁盘空间与权限后重试。不保存而继续的进度仅保留到游戏关闭。",
&"Recovery could not be saved: %s": &"恢复结果无法保存：%s",
&"Could not open deployment: %s. Retry from loadout.": &"无法打开出击场景：%s。请返回配装界面重试。",
&"First Mission requires AR in PRIMARY WEAPON and SMG in SECONDARY WEAPON. Equip them in the Hanger, then confirm deployment.": &"首个任务需要主武器装备 AR 突击步枪、副武器装备 SMG 冲锋枪。请在机库完成配装后确认出击。",
&"Equip at least one weapon before deployment.": &"出击前请至少装备一把武器。",
&"Equipment is overweight. Select a lighter loadout.": &"装备超重，请减轻负重。",
&"Profile is unavailable. Return to the menu to recover your save.": &"角色资料不可用，请返回主菜单恢复存档。",
&"Overview": &"总览",
&"Hanger": &"机库",
&"Operations": &"作战室",
&"Workshop": &"工坊",
&"Rest": &"休息室",
&"OVERVIEW": &"总览",
&"HANGER": &"机库",
&"OPERATIONS": &"作战室",
&"WORKSHOP": &"工坊",
&"REST": &"休息室",
&"HOME SIGNAL STABLE    •    ESC / PAUSE": &"基地信号稳定 · Esc 暂停",
&"SELECT A BAY BELOW  /  PREPARE • DEPLOY • RECOVER": &"选择下方区域 / 整备 · 出击 · 回收",
&"CONFIRM DEPLOYMENT": &"确认出击",
&"MISSION TERMINAL": &"任务终端",
&"SECOND SORTIE / LOADOUT": &"第二次出击 / 配装",
&"FIRST MISSION / 10 MIN": &"首个任务 / 约 10 分钟",
&"FIRST MISSION / DEPLOY": &"首个任务 / 准备出击",
&"SELECT BUNNY": &"选择 Bunny",
&"SELECT AR + SMG": &"装备 AR 突击步枪 + SMG 冲锋枪",
&"WORKSHOP / FIRST UPGRADE": &"工坊 / 首次升级",
&"HOME SIGNAL RECOVERED\n\nSalvage is now in your warehouse.\nVisit Workshop for your first upgrade.": &"归途信号已恢复\n\n回收物已存入仓库。\n前往工坊进行首次升级。",
&"BUNNY / FIELD OPERATOR\n\nAR + SMG / starter kit\n\nLearn. Investigate. Choose your risk.\nExtract. Upgrade. Deploy again.": &"Bunny / 外勤干员\n\n初始武器：AR 突击步枪 + SMG 冲锋枪\n\n学习操作、调查终端、选择风险。\n撤离、升级，再次出击。",
&"WAREHOUSE / SALVAGE CORE × %d\n\nAR / WEAPON UPGRADE\nCost: 1 Salvage Core\nDamage: 20 → 22 (+10%%)\n\n%s": &"仓库 / 回收核心 × %d\n\nAR 突击步枪 / 武器升级\n消耗：1 个回收核心\n伤害：20 → 22（+10%%）\n\n%s",
&"INSTALLED / READY FOR SORTIE 02": &"已安装 / 准备第二次出击",
&"Materials secured. Install your upgrade.": &"材料已入库，可以安装升级。",
&"Bring materials home from First Mission.": &"完成首个任务并带回材料。",
&"UPGRADE AR / 1 SALVAGE CORE": &"升级 AR / 消耗 1 个回收核心",
&"Upgrade could not be saved: %s. Your materials are unchanged.": &"升级无法保存：%s。材料未扣除。",
&"OPERATION / SIGNAL RECOVERY\nURBAN DISTRICT 07\n\n": &"行动 / 信号回收\n城区 07\n\n",
&"\nRecover supplies. Reach the south\nextraction beacon to return alive.": &"\n回收补给，抵达南侧撤离信标，\n安全返回基地。",
&"Your forward operating base.\n\nEquip in the Hanger.\nReview the operation at the Terminal.\nReturn here with what you recover.": &"你的前线基地。\n\n在机库配置装备。\n在终端查看任务。\n带回搜刮物品，返回这里。",
&"PERSONAL QUARTERS\n\nKohaku — field operator.\nThe city's security network is hostile.\nThis room is still yours.\n\nRecover. Re-equip. Come home.": &"个人休息室\n\n琥珀——外勤干员。\n城市安保网络已成为敌人。\n这间房仍然属于你。\n\n休整、重新配装、回家。",
&"HANGER 07  /  COMBAT LOADOUT  /  ESC PAUSE": &"07 号机库 / 战斗配装 / Esc 暂停",
&"EQUIPMENT": &"装备",
&"PRIMARY WEAPON": &"主武器",
&"SECONDARY WEAPON": &"副武器",
&"ARMOR / MOBILITY vs PROTECTION": &"护甲 / 机动与防护",
&"BACKPACK": &"背包",
&"DEPLOY": &"出击",
&"WAREHOUSE": &"仓库",
&"WEAPONS": &"武器",
&"AMMO": &"弹药",
&"SALVAGE": &"回收物",
&"PRIMARY": &"主武器",
&"SECONDARY": &"副武器",
&"ARMOR": &"护甲",
&"NONE": &"无",
&"No weapon equipped": &"未装备武器",
&"AUTO": &"全自动",
&"SINGLE": &"单发",
&"CAPACITY  %.2f / %.0f kg": &"仓库容量  %.2f / %.0f kg",
&"%s / %s / MAG %d\nDMG %s / %.1fs RELOAD / %.0fm": &"%s / %s / 弹匣 %d\n伤害 %s / 换弹 %.1f 秒 / 射程 %.0f 米",
&"MOBILITY  %.1f m/s (primary equipped)\nPROTECTION  %.0f%% incoming damage reduction\nCARRY WEIGHT  %.1f kg (armor)": &"机动  %.1f 米/秒（当前主武器）\n防护  减少 %.0f%% 所受伤害\n负重  护甲 %.1f kg",
&"SORTIE  %.1f / %.0f kg\n%s\nExtra warehouse ammunition stays at base.": &"出击负重  %.1f / %.0f kg\n%s\n多余弹药留在基地仓库。",
&" (EMPTY)": &"（无弹药）",
&"01 / FIND YOUR FEET\nWASD / left stick — move 3 metres.": &"01 / 熟悉移动\nWASD / 左摇杆——移动 3 米。",
&"02 / LOOK BEFORE YOU SHOOT\nMouse / right stick — turn your aim.": &"02 / 观察与瞄准\n鼠标 / 右摇杆——改变瞄准方向。",
&"03 / LIVE FIRE\nLeft click / right trigger — fire your AR.": &"03 / 实弹射击\n鼠标左键 / 右扳机——开火。",
&"04 / FIRST PMC\nUse cover. Fire at the patrol. Q switches to SMG.": &"04 / 首次遭遇 PMC\n利用掩体击败巡逻兵。Q 切换武器。",
&"05 / A FRESH MAGAZINE\nR — reload. Then search the fallen patrol's case.": &"05 / 换弹\nR 换弹，然后搜查巡逻兵的补给箱。",
&"06 / YOUR FIRST SALVAGE\nE — open the case. TAKE the Salvage Core.": &"06 / 第一次搜刮\nE 打开补给箱，取走回收核心。",
&"07 / RECOVER THE HOME SIGNAL\nFind the field terminal. E — investigate for 8s.": &"07 / 恢复归途信号\n找到外勤终端，按 E 调查 8 秒。",
&"08 / THE ALARM IS LIVE\nOne core secured. Extra salvage or a safe return?": &"08 / 警报已触发\n已获得 1 个核心。继续搜刮，还是撤离？",
&"09 / SOMETHING WORTH THE RISK\nSearch the north cache. You can still extract anytime.": &"09 / 值得冒险的物资\n搜查北侧补给箱，随时可以选择撤离。",
&"10 / COME HOME\nE at the south beacon. Defend for 8s.": &"10 / 回家\n在南侧信标按 E，坚守 8 秒。",
&"CONTINUE / SALVAGE": &"继续冒险 / 搜刮",
&"EXTRACT / KEEP CARGO": &"直接撤离 / 保住物资",
&"TRAINING / SOUTH ACCESS": &"训练 / 南侧入口",
&"PMC PATROL": &"PMC 巡逻兵",
&"PATROL SUPPLIES / 1 CORE": &"巡逻兵补给 / 1 个核心",
