&"5.56 STANDARD": &"5.56 毫米普通弹",
&"7.62 MATCH": &"7.62 毫米精确弹",
&"12 GAUGE BUCKSHOT": &"12 号鹿弹",
&"BREACH ROCKET": &"爆破火箭弹",
&"STANDARD CARRIED EQUIPMENT PACK.": &"标准野战携行背包。",
&"STABLE MEDIUM-RANGE AUTOMATIC RIFLE.": &"稳定的中距离全自动步枪。",
&"LIGHT CLOSE-RANGE AUTOMATIC WEAPON.": &"轻型近距离全自动武器。",
&"SLOW PRECISION RIFLE WITH ARMOR PENETRATION. HOLD SHIFT TO EXTEND THE SIGHTLINE.": &"射速较慢的穿甲精确步枪。按住 Shift 扩展观察视野。",
&"SINGLE-SHOT SHOULDER LAUNCHER. EXPLOSIVE ROCKETS BREAK BARRIERS AND DAMAGE GROUPS.": &"单发肩射火箭筒，爆炸可破坏障碍并伤害成群敌人。",
&"MODERN FIREARM AMMUNITION.": &"现代枪械弹药。",
&"GENERAL-PURPOSE RIFLE AMMUNITION.": &"通用步枪弹药。",
&"ARMOR-PIERCING RIFLE AMMUNITION WITH INCREASED CARRIED WEIGHT AND VALUE.": &"穿甲步枪弹药，重量和价值较高。",
&"STANDARD EXPLOSIVE AMMUNITION FOR THE BREACH LAUNCHER.": &"火箭筒使用的标准爆炸弹药。",
&"MOBILITY PACK WITH COMPACT MANEUVERING THRUSTERS.": &"带有小型机动推进器的携行背包。",
&"LIGHT SEMI-AUTOMATIC SIDEARM. ONE SHOT PER TRIGGER PRESS; SHARES 9MM WITH THE SMG.": &"轻型半自动手枪。每次扣扳机射击一次，与冲锋枪共用 9 毫米弹药。",
&"BELT-FED AUTOMATIC SUPPORT WEAPON. LARGE BOX MAGAZINE, SUSTAINED SPREAD AND A SLOW RELOAD.": &"弹链供弹的全自动支援武器，大容量弹箱，持续射击扩散较大、换弹较慢。",
&"PUMP-ACTION SHOTGUN. EIGHT PELLETS PER SHELL; SPREAD REWARDS CLOSE-RANGE POSITIONING.": &"泵动霰弹枪，每发含 8 颗弹丸，适合近距离作战。",
&"THE CITY WENT SILENT. BASTION 07 STAYED ON THE AIR.": &"城市陷入沉寂，07 号堡垒仍在广播。",
&"YOU ARE KOHAKU. YOUR FRAME IS READY. THE SECURITY NETWORK IS NOT ON YOUR SIDE.": &"你是琥珀。装甲已经就绪，安保网络却已与你为敌。",
&"ACCESS THE FIELD OFFICE. RECOVER SUPPLIES. REACH EXTRACTION. COME HOME.": &"进入外勤办公室，回收补给，抵达撤离点，回家。",
&"SUPPLY CASE": &"补给箱",
&"Deployment has no session. Return to base and retry.": &"出击状态不可用，请返回基地重试。",
&"Could not open the mission. Return to base and retry.": &"无法进入任务，请返回基地重试。",
