&"DISTRICT 07\nFIELD OFFICE / SIGNAL RECOVERY": &"城区 07\n外勤办公室 / 信号回收",
&"KOHAKU / ON STANDBY": &"琥珀 / 待命",
&"01 / HANGER": &"01 / 机库",
&"Scene transition failed: %s. Retry from exit options.": &"场景切换失败：%s。请在退出选项中重试。",
&"Could not open the destination: %s. Progress is retained; retry from exit options.": &"无法打开目标场景：%s。进度已保留，请在退出选项中重试。",
&"Profile recovered. Retry returning to base: %s": &"存档已恢复，返回基地时请重试：%s",
&"No debrief is available. Return to base to start a new sortie.": &"暂无结算记录，请返回基地开始新的出击。",
&"The sortie could not be recovered. Return to base to continue.": &"无法恢复此次出击，请返回基地继续。",
&"Could not open Hanger: %s": &"无法打开机库：%s",
&"UNARMED": &"未装备",
&"%s\nTARGET  %s": &"%s\n目标  %s",
&"BASE": &"基地",
&" (ARMOR)": &"（护甲）",
&"%.0f (+10%%)": &"%.0f（+10%%）",
&"DEPLOYMENT HAS NO SESSION. RETURN TO BASE AND RETRY.": &"出击状态不可用，请返回基地重试。",
&"COULD NOT OPEN THE MISSION. RETURN TO BASE AND RETRY.": &"无法进入任务，请返回基地重试。",
&"NO DEBRIEF IS AVAILABLE. RETURN TO BASE TO START A NEW SORTIE.": &"暂无结算记录，请返回基地开始新的出击。",
&"THE SORTIE COULD NOT BE RECOVERED. RETURN TO BASE TO CONTINUE.": &"无法恢复此次出击，请返回基地继续。",
