&"ROTATE / R": &"旋转 / R",
&"DRAG / EQUIP": &"拖动物品整理\n拖入装备槽配装",
&"SELECT AN ITEM\n\nDrag to organize.\nDrop gear on an equipment slot.\n\nR / Rotate\nDouble-click / Equip": &"选择一件物品\n\n拖动整理仓库。\n拖入对应装备槽配装。\n\nR / 旋转\n双击 / 装备",
&"%d × %d CELLS\n%.2f kg\nQuantity / %d\nCondition / %.0f%%": &"%d × %d 格\n%.2f kg\n数量 / %d\n耐久 / %.0f%%",
